  <section class="section shell" id="contact">
    <div class="sec-head" data-rv>
      <p class="badge">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="100" d="M3.5 19C5.8 11.5 8.8 8.5 12 8.5S18.2 11.5 20.5 19"/><path pathLength="100" d="M7 19c1.6-4.6 3.2-6.4 5-6.4s3.4 1.8 5 6.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="3.8" r="1.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
        CONTACT
      </p>
      <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Talk to the<br>Field Office.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div data-rv>
        <p class="contact-intro">Email reaches us fastest. The field teams are out most days, the office phone is answered when someone is in, and every message that lands here is read by a person, not a ticket system.</p>
        <div class="c-rows">
          <div class="c-row">
            <span class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-5.5-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 5.5-7 11-7 11Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.6"/></svg></span>
            <div><h4>Office</h4><p>Jl. Ahmad Yani No. 88, Pontianak,<br>West Kalimantan 78124</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="c-row">
            <span class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="3"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg></span>
            <div><h4>Email</h4><p><a href="mailto:halo@rimba.or.id">halo@rimba.or.id</a></p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="c-row">
            <span class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a12 12 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/></svg></span>
            <div><h4>Phone &amp; WhatsApp</h4><p><a href="tel:+6281234567890">+62 812 3456 7890</a></p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="c-row">
            <span class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"/></svg></span>
            <div><h4>Office Hours</h4><p>Monday to Friday, 08.00–16.00 WIB</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="posts">
          <h4>Field Posts</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Kubu Raya <span>Peatland crew base</span></li>
            <li>Demak <span>Mangrove nursery</span></li>
            <li>North Luwu <span>Watershed team</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="promise"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6.5 9.5 17 4 11.5"/></svg>We reply within two working days, usually faster.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cform-card" data-rv style="--d:.1s">
        <form class="cform" id="contactForm" novalidate>
          <div class="row2">
            <div>
              <label for="cName">Your name</label>
              <input type="text" id="cName" name="name" placeholder="Full name" autocomplete="name" required>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="cEmail">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="cEmail" name="email" placeholder="Your email address" autocomplete="email" required>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="cTopic">Topic</label>
            <select id="cTopic" name="topic">
              <option>Volunteering</option>
              <option>Partnership</option>
              <option>Donations</option>
              <option>Press</option>
              <option>Something else</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="cMsg">Message</label>
            <textarea id="cMsg" name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you need, and where you are based." required></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-forest">Send Message <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-msg" id="contactMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="min-height:0"><span class="ok-lottie" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="msg-txt"></span></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq" data-rv>
      <h3 class="faq-h">Questions We Hear Most</h3>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I visit a planting site?</summary>
        <p>Yes, on planting days: the second Saturday of most months in Kubu Raya, the third in Demak. Groups are capped at 15 so the crews can still work. Write through the form at least two weeks ahead and we will send the meeting point and what to bring.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How is a donation actually used?</summary>
        <p>In 2025, 62% of spending went to field operations and crew wages, and crews are paid weekly at rates posted in the village office. As a guide, Rp150,000 covers one ranger's full patrol day: fuel, food, and the log keeper's time.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do you take volunteers?</summary>
        <p>Field volunteers stay a minimum of two weeks and work under a site coordinator. Nursery and planting work needs no experience; accompanying a patrol does. In Pontianak, office volunteers help with data entry after every count.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can our company partner on a site?</summary>
        <p>Usually by funding a named piece of work: one canal block costs Rp48,000,000 to build and maintain for five years, and a kilometre of mangrove line runs to about Rp95,000,000. Partners receive the same counts as everyone else, in the same month. There is no special report.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
